tags: party_affairs

= Choosing our enemies

In our media and campaign materials, who should we consider as our main opponents?

[? if enemies != 0 : Previously, we had considered the [+ enemies +] as our prior enemies. Is a change of direction necessary? ?]

- @anti_dem: The anti-democratic parties of the far right and left - the KPD, NSDAP, and DNVP.
- @far_right: The far right - the NSDAP and DNVP.
- @dnvp: The DNVP alone.
- @kpd: The KPD.
- @socialist: The Socialist parties of the SPD, KPD and the USPD.
- @easy_discard

@anti_dem
on-arrival: enemies = "Anti-democratic parties"; sammlung_strength += 5; linksliberale_strength += 5; new_middle_kpd -= 2; new_middle_nsdap -= 2; new_middle_dnvp -= 2; kpd_relation -= 10

Attacking the far right and left is popular among all of our party except some members of the nationalliberale, who would prefer we keep our options open with the DNVP. 

@far_right
on-arrival: enemies = "Far-Right"; linksliberale_strength += 5; linksliberale_dissent -= 5; new_middle_nsdap -= 3; new_middle_dnvp -= 3

Attacking the far right is popular among the entire party (except some more right-wing members who would prefer we also go after the KPD). Our bourgeois coalition partners are also skeptical of our lack of commitment to anti-communism.

@dnvp
on-arrival: enemies = "DNVP"; linksliberale_dissent -= 6; dnvp_relations -= 8; new_middle_dnvp -= 7; nationalliberale_dissent += 4

Atacking the DNVP is popular amongst the left of our party, as it is an anti-democratic party, but some members of the nationalliberale would prefer we keep our options open with them, while other members would rather we focus on more parties than solely the DNVP.

@kpd
on-arrival: enemies = "KPD"; nationalliberale_strength += 5; kpd_relation -= 10; dvp_relation += 5; z_relation += 5; new_middle_kpd -= 4

Attacking the KPD is supported by all but the most left-wing socialists, and wins us approval amongst the right. However, some in our party are skeptic of only focusing on the KPD

@socialist
on-arrival: enemies = "Socialists"; nationalliberale_strength += 5; linksliberale_strength -= 5; spd_relations -= 5; dnvp_relations += 5; uspd_relations -= 5; kpd_relations -= 5; new_middle_spd -= 4; new_middle_kpd -= 4; new_middle_uspd -= 4; dnvp_relations += 5; dvp_relations += 8
choose-if: linksliberale_strength >= 10
unavailable-subtitle: The left in our party would never allow this. 

Atacking the socialists is supported by the right, especialy the far-right, but alienates us from the SPD who are otherwise one of the most democratic parties. 
